  "sourceBoundContracts": [
    "Native column description upper-only65535 clamp, signed width/limits, default0 edges/active, table=false and ortho=true.",
    "Append and Clone copy mutable fields; equality excludes ortho; active consistency only checks index/count.",
    "View table columns subtract Left, mirror RTL order/limits, clamp frame distances at zero then uint16 cast, append visible unconstrained tail.",
    "Document drag consumes actual view item visibility/end/min/max; original SwTabCols still owns preview/model/apply, unchanged native shell/history.",
    "Only native Library_svx svx->svl edge admitted; reverse SW/browser ownership rejected."
  ],
  "residuals": [
    "Full SvxRuler/SfxBindings/SfxItemSet slot dispatch and StateTabWin page/frame/section owners not yet ported.",
    "Row value conversion and native active-column production selection, vertical/RTL document drag, pooled refcount guard and full uint16 WhichId domain remain partial.",
    "UNO nonzero member QueryValue/PutValue and GetPresentation/CreateDefault are not represented; default member-zero query has no payload.",
    "Browser IO/settings/open/save/recovery deviations remain untouched. Two expected current-baseline UI guard rejections are captured at the host Promise boundary with exact error assertions, not claimed as successful ordinary browser flows."
  ]
